  "id": "art-0063-katie-patel-press-secretary-2026",
  "slug": "katie-zacharia-white-house-press-secretary",
  "headline": "Trump Names Commentator Katie Zacharia as White House Press Secretary",
  "socialHeadline": "President Trump has picked conservative commentator and attorney Katie Zacharia as his new White House press secretary, succeeding Karoline Leavitt",
  "summary": "President Donald Trump announced on October 9 that conservative commentator and attorney Katie Zacharia will serve as White House press secretary, succeeding Karoline Leavitt. Zacharia, a mother of four who briefly served in the Department of Homeland Security, is set to begin Monday with her first briefing scheduled for Tuesday morning.",
  "body": [
   "President Donald Trump announced on October 9 that Katie Zacharia, a conservative commentator and attorney, will become the new White House press secretary, succeeding Karoline Leavitt.",
   "\"She has an unblemished record of support, and has been a loyal and brilliant supporter, right from the beginning,\" Trump said in his announcement, posted to Truth Social.",
   "Zacharia, a mother of four, previously served briefly as a deputy assistant secretary for public affairs at the Department of Homeland Security from February to March 2026. She becomes Trump's sixth chief spokesperson across his two administrations.",
   "\"Serving President Trump and the American people at this critical 250-year mark is the honor of a lifetime,\" Zacharia said.",
   "Leavitt announced her departure on August 12 and left the role on August 27; Trump consulted her before choosing Zacharia, according to CNN. Zacharia is scheduled to start on Monday, October 12, with her first press briefing set for Tuesday, October 13, at 9:30 a.m. Eastern."
  ],
