 {
  "id": "art-0069-michigan-underwood-qb1-2026",
  "slug": "michigan-underwood-qb1-beck-playcaller-whittingham-2026",
  "headline": "Michigan Sticking With Bryce Underwood at QB as Jason Beck Keeps Play-Calling",
  "socialHeadline": "No changes in Ann Arbor: Michigan's Kyle Whittingham confirms Bryce Underwood stays QB1 and Jason Beck keeps calling plays after the bye",
  "summary": "Michigan head coach Kyle Whittingham confirmed that Bryce Underwood will remain the starting quarterback and offensive coordinator Jason Beck will keep play-calling duties after the bye week, despite a 3\u20132 start and back-to-back Big Ten losses.",
  "body": [
   "Michigan will not make changes at quarterback or play-caller coming out of its bye week, head coach Kyle Whittingham confirmed on Monday. Bryce Underwood remains the starting quarterback and offensive coordinator Jason Beck will continue calling plays.",
   "\"Jason will call plays and Bryce is our guy,\" Whittingham said, ending speculation about a shake-up after consecutive losses.",
   "## A rough two weeks",
   "The Wolverines sit at 3\u20132 overall and 0\u20132 in the Big Ten after a 20\u201319 loss to Iowa and a 20\u201314 defeat at Minnesota. The offense has sputtered: Michigan ranks 17th of 18 Big Ten teams in scoring at 23.0 points per game.",
   "Underwood's numbers reflect the struggle. The quarterback has completed 59.3% of his passes for 881 yards with 5 touchdowns and 4 interceptions, adding 212 rushing yards.",
   "## Penn State next",
   "Michigan hosts Penn State on Saturday. The Nittany Lions are 3\u20133 overall and 0\u20133 in the conference, making it a matchup of two programs desperate to steady their seasons.",
   "Whittingham's public backing of both his quarterback and his play-caller is a bet on continuity: with half the season remaining, Michigan's staff believes the offense's problems are fixable without structural change.",
   "## What remains unknown",
   "Whether patience pays off will be decided on the field. A third straight loss would intensify pressure on both Underwood and Beck. NewsVeria will update this story after Saturday's game."
  ],
  "category": "Sports",
  "tags": [
   "Michigan",
   "College Football",
   "Bryce Underwood",
