 {
  "id": "art-0070-eagles-shipley-injury-2026",
  "slug": "eagles-will-shipley-plantar-fascia-tear-injury-2026",
  "headline": "Eagles RB Will Shipley Suffers Partial Plantar Fascia Tear, Could Miss Weeks",
  "socialHeadline": "Eagles lose another RB: Will Shipley suffered a partial plantar fascia tear in the London loss to Jacksonville and could miss multiple weeks",
  "summary": "Philadelphia Eagles running back Will Shipley suffered a partial tear of his plantar fascia during Sunday's 19\u201317 loss to the Jacksonville Jaguars in London and is expected to miss multiple weeks, ESPN's Adam Schefter reported.",
  "body": [
   "Philadelphia Eagles running back Will Shipley suffered a partial tear of his plantar fascia during Sunday's game against the Jacksonville Jaguars in London and could miss multiple weeks, ESPN's Adam Schefter reported on Monday.",
   "Shipley was injured during the Eagles' 19\u201317 loss at Tottenham Hotspur Stadium and did not return. The partial tear diagnosis suggests an absence measured in weeks rather than days, though the team has not announced a formal timetable.",
   "## A depleted backfield",
   "Shipley is the third Eagles running back hurt in the past two weeks. Star Saquon Barkley is dealing with a hamstring injury, and Tank Bigsby is on injured reserve following core-muscle surgery \u2014 leaving Philadelphia's ground game dangerously thin.",
   "The timing is awkward: the Eagles dropped to a losing effort in London and now face reshuffling their backfield rotation just as the season's middle stretch begins.",
   "## What a plantar fascia tear means",
   "The plantar fascia is the band of tissue along the sole of the foot; partial tears are a known football injury that typically sidelines players for several weeks depending on severity. Teams often manage them cautiously given the re-injury risk for running backs.",
   "## What remains unknown",
   "The Eagles have not confirmed a recovery timeline, and it is unclear whether Shipley will be placed on injured reserve. NewsVeria will update this story when the team issues an official injury designation."
  ],
  "category": "Sports",
  "tags": [
